      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "TAW UNBOUND (8) was quickly out of the boxes with a slick early sectional clocking 30.50 with a one length win at Angle Park over 530m. Winner at his latest appearance in one of the quickest times on the card. Hard to go past. ZIPPING TESFAY (4) turned in a plain performance last time when sixth at Healesville over 300m behind Santana Boy (16.79) in a Free For All. Consistent performer from this draw with a win and two minor placings to her credit. Cannot be taken lightly. OPAWA LEO (6) is progressing well and looks close to another win after hitting the frame from Box 8 last run (30.58) at Addington. Yet to taste defeat from two runs out of this box. Leading player again. MIGHTY MISS (2) can improve on an unplaced run here last time out.",
